\pard\sb80\sa60\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw10\brsp20{\b\fs22 SUMMARY}\par
\pard\sa120 Self-directed penetration tester focused on web and Android application security, with a public portfolio built around the OWASP Top 10, the OWASP Mobile Top 10 (2024), and the OWASP MASVS/MASTG. I document complete assessment workflows - static and dynamic analysis, exploitation, CVSS-scored findings, and remediation - the way a client report reads. Seven and a half years in the U.S. Navy built the precision, security discipline, and clear technical communication the work demands, and recent software QA work kept me finding and documenting defects daily. Bilingual (English/Japanese, JLPT N3), remote-ready, and pursuing a B.S. in Cybersecurity Technology. Seeking an Associate Security Consultant role to grow under experienced consultants while contributing real testing and reporting from day one.\par
